Dear Michael,

At 01:05 PM 9/25/2002 -0400, Michael Slattery wrote:
> Hello all, I am trying to produce a series of plots of X1 vs Y1 from a
> data frame where X1 and Y1 do not necessarily have the same number of
> elements. How can I force pairing of X1 & Y1 so as to drop those which are
